{"5238060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lucky Shot VR","steam_appid":5238060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5301500],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shooting range in VR. Aim with tracked motion controllers and bring your build to life around you. A PC-compatible VR headset and tracked controllers are required.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A flick-shot dopamine machine<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Shot VR<\/strong> is a roguelike mag-builder FPS where precise shooting meets wild buildcrafting. Master different weapons, stack Holos, arrange special bullets, and combine charms, energy drinks, and target upgrades into absurd, run-breaking combos. Land clean shots, grow huge multipliers, and push the score until the run breaks wide open.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build wild combos. Break the shooting range.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each run around the tools you find. Reach the required score, defeat the bosses, and keep the run alive as every choice changes what your next shot can do.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 150+ Holos that stack, synergize, and bend the rules in different ways<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 12 different weapons, each with a unique playstyle that changes how you approach every run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special bullets for your mag that define your build and shape each run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ bosses that test both your aim and your build<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 16+ charms that stay with you throughout the run and trigger special effects<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ energy drinks with side effects that can save a run or wreck it completely<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special target types that let you influence what spawns next. The range is yours<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New stages, new eras, new tracks<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage pays tribute to a different era, with its own visual identity and soundtrack.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy matters as much as aim<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not need to be an FPS expert. Lucky Shot VR is designed for shooter and deckbuilder players alike: strong aim can push a build further, while smart synergies and magazine planning can turn every shot into something spectacular.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shooting range in VR. Aim with tracked motion controllers and bring your build to life around you. A PC-compatible VR headset and tracked controllers are required.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A flick-shot dopamine machine<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Shot VR<\/strong> is a roguelike mag-builder FPS where precise shooting meets wild buildcrafting. Master different weapons, stack Holos, arrange special bullets, and combine charms, energy drinks, and target upgrades into absurd, run-breaking combos. Land clean shots, grow huge multipliers, and push the score until the run breaks wide open.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build wild combos. Break the shooting range.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each run around the tools you find. Reach the required score, defeat the bosses, and keep the run alive as every choice changes what your next shot can do.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 150+ Holos that stack, synergize, and bend the rules in different ways<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 12 different weapons, each with a unique playstyle that changes how you approach every run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special bullets for your mag that define your build and shape each run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ bosses that test both your aim and your build<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 16+ charms that stay with you throughout the run and trigger special effects<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ energy drinks with side effects that can save a run or wreck it completely<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special target types that let you influence what spawns next. The range is yours<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New stages, new eras, new tracks<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage pays tribute to a different era, with its own visual identity and soundtrack.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy matters as much as aim<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not need to be an FPS expert. Lucky Shot VR is designed for shooter and deckbuilder players alike: strong aim can push a build further, while smart synergies and magazine planning can turn every shot into something spectacular.<\/p>","short_description":"A shooting dopamine machine! Lucky Shot VR is a roguelike mag-builder FPS where you master different weapons, build wild combos, and break the game to reach massive high scores.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5238060\/8f264929fc196ea0d181a1108041814de27c7509\/header.jpg?t=1793766643","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5238060\/021289f30ae503d1a4c6462ea2f436222399da2c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793766643","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5238060\/021289f30ae503d1a4c6462ea2f436222399da2c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793766643","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> OpenXR. Requires a PC-compatible VR headset and tracked motion controllers.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/st